Community Data License Agreement - Permissive - Version 2.0

This is the Community Data License Agreement - Permissive, Version 2.0
("Agreement"). Data is provided to You under this Agreement by each of
the Data Providers. Your exercise of any of the rights and permissions
granted below constitutes Your acceptance and agreement to be bound by
the terms and conditions of this Agreement.

The benefits that each Data Provider receives from making Data available
and that You receive from Data or Output is sufficient consideration to
form this Agreement.

Section 1. Definitions

1.1 "Data" means the material provided to You under this Agreement.

1.2 "Data Provider" means any person who is the source of Data provided
    to You under this Agreement and in compliance with Section 2.

1.3 "Output" means any artifact that is created by You from Data or
    through the use of Data, to the extent it does not include more than
    a de minimis portion of the Data on which the Output is based. Output
    may include, but is not limited to, models trained on Data.

1.4 "You" or "Your" means any natural or legal person who exercises the
    rights or permissions granted by this Agreement, and any person that
    You permit to have access to the Data.

Section 2. Right and License

2.1 Subject to the terms of this Agreement, each Data Provider hereby
    grants to You a worldwide, non-exclusive, irrevocable (except as
    provided in Section 5) right to: (a) use, modify, and share the Data;
    and (b) use, modify, and share Output.

2.2 To the extent that the Data or Output is protected by any law or
    regulation, including any sui generis right, each Data Provider
    hereby waives and/or agrees not to assert any rights that would
    otherwise prevent or inhibit the exercise of rights under Section
    2.1.

Section 3. Conditions

3.1 If You share Data, You must (a) include with the Data a copy of, or
    a URI for, this Agreement, and (b) not modify this Agreement.

Section 4. No Warranties

4.1 All Data is provided on an "AS IS" basis. EACH DATA PROVIDER
    DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES, WHETHER EXPRESS, IMPLIED, OR STATUTORY, OF
    ANY KIND WITH RESPECT TO THE DATA, INCLUDING WITHOUT LIMITATION,
    TITLE, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, ACCURACY, COMPLETENESS,
    QUALITY, MERCHANTABILITY, AND NONINFRINGEMENT.

4.2 EACH DATA PROVIDER DISCLAIMS ALL LIABILITY FOR ANY LOSSES, DAMAGES,
    CLAIMS, EXPENSES, OR OTHER COSTS THAT RESULT FROM, ARISE OUT OF, OR
    RELATE IN ANY WAY TO ANY DATA.

Section 5. Termination

5.1 All of Your rights under this Agreement will terminate if You fail
    to comply with any of the terms of this Agreement.

5.2 If Your rights under this Agreement terminate, You agree to cease
    use and sharing of the Data. However, Your right under Section 2.1(b)
    to use, modify, and share Output will survive termination of this
    Agreement.
